# Merge drivers for files a text merge gets wrong (ADR 0460). Register them
# with ./scripts/merge-drivers.sh; /harden does it before merging main. A clone
# without the registration merges these paths as plain text.

# The ADR index: numbered lines, kept sorted, one per number.
docs/adr/index.md merge=lucidos-sorted-lines

# Registries: entries keyed by heading path or bullet label. Two entries added
# at one spot both stay; two edits to one entry still conflict.
